<title>USA: Hi-Tech Pharmacal says to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Hi-Tech Pharmacal says to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>AMITYVILLE, N.Y. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hi-Tech Pharmacal Co Inc said Thursday that it authorized the repurchase of up to $500,000 of its common stock.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3/8 at 4-3/4 in early afternoon trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said the stock purchases will be made from time to time in the open market, and in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
